// Zephira combat follower: copied from the Dark Horizons Tristan/Isolde
// architecture, with a dedicated override fallback so she changes allegiance
// as soon as Dimwoork starts the fight.
IF
  Global("DH9_TRIST_FIGHT","GLOBAL",1)
  !Allegiance(Myself,ENEMY)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    Enemy()
    AttackReevaluate(Player1,30)
END
